@@ -0,0 +1,313 @@
+# PayPal integration plan — Fogline Supply Co.
+
+## Scope
+
+Add PayPal checkout (PayPal / Venmo / Pay Later buttons + Pay Later messaging, Web SDK v6 in the
+browser) next to the existing card form. Fulfil a shop order only after PayPal has really captured
+the right amount. Keep card checkout and `npm test` green. No live PayPal calls while building
+(no credentials exist); tests use a faked `fetch` (no network). The harness later runs the shop
+against the PayPal sandbox.
