+| `prefer` | Rule 4 verification: the response must carry the full purchase unit (amount + `custom_id`) to check before the order id is handed to the browser | ✅ `"return=representation"` |
+| `payPalMockResponse` | nothing (negative-testing header; never forwarded from the browser) | ❌ leave it out |
+| `payPalPartnerAttributionId` | nothing | ❌ leave it out |
+| `payPalClientMetadataId` | nothing | ❌ leave it out |
+| `payPalAuthAssertion` | nothing | ❌ leave it out |
