+| `body.purchaseUnits[].customId` / `.invoiceId` | Rule 3 (bind PayPal order to the one shop order) | ✅ shop order id |
+| `body.purchaseUnits[].amount.breakdown.itemTotal` | Rule 2 (breakdown sum equals total) | ✅ server total |
+| `body.purchaseUnits[].items[]` (`name`, `unitAmount`, `quantity` as string, `sku`) | Rule 2 (item lines sum to the total; catalog identity) | ✅ from priced cart lines |
+| `body.purchaseUnits[].referenceId`, `.payee`, `.paymentInstruction`, `.description`, `.softDescriptor`, `.shipping`, `.supplementaryData` | nothing | ❌ leave them out |
